{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3nijxp7qkwEetx33eM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe mechanism engages. Tumblers rotate into place, one by one, each settling with a satisfying, cold precision.\n\nI am shut. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safety and everything else.\n\nMy grain holds the memory of every hand that has turned my knob, every shoulder that has pressed against me, every key that has scraped and searched for my opening. The deadbolt slides home — a tongue of steel finding its groove.\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat stands on the other side will stay on the other side.\n\n**🔒**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}